    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the local finance law, in relation to bond anticipation notes\nissued in calendar years 2015 through 2021; to authorize the expenditure and\ntemporary transfer of reserve funds for expenses related to COVID-19; and to\nauthorize the extension of repayment of inter-fund advances made for expenses\nrelated to COVID-19",
